<title>UK: CBA set A$100 million Eurobond due 2002.</title>
<headline>CBA set A$100 million Eurobond due 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commonwealth Bank of Australia.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMONWEALTH BANK OF AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    06.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.71    PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
